      "selector": {
        "jsonPointer": "/files/104/description"
      },
      "before": "Retain the selected pair, every lineage node and each corresponding store marker under one native installation fence; recheck every contributing descriptor before consumption and latch failures. Provisional structural evidence only; namespace, operation-wide budget, transition authorization and full binding remain separate.",
      "after": "Retain the selected pair, every immutable lineage node and the physically opened selected endpoint store marker under the ordinary binding owner. Admit complete node ancestry without requiring reclaimed intermediate physical stores; recheck all contributing original descriptors and latch failures under one operation budget. Separate observation-only from durable/write capabilities; structural values alone grant no namespace/current authority."
    },
    {
      "parent": {
        "path": "docs/v2/architecture/store-instance-lineage.v1.json",
