      },
      "selector": {
        "jsonPointer": "/standing"
      },
      "before": "Author correction for review finding PS-01, revision 5. Proposed minimal successor delta to the security S9 owner plus its private lifecycle companion. Not an accepted amendment, not executable product code, not a wire schema and not acceptance of frozen candidate25 bytes. Requires its own substantive review on newly frozen bytes.",
      "after": "Author correction for review finding PS-01, revision 5. Proposed minimal successor delta to the security S9 owner plus its private lifecycle companion. Not an accepted amendment, not executable product code, not a wire schema and not acceptance of frozen candidate25 bytes. Requires its own substantive review on newly frozen bytes. Initial/ordinary native binding is now separately specified in docs/implementation/m2/initial-root-binding-owner-selection-v1/owner.md; it preserves these private shapes/digest recipes while requiring physical markers only at opened endpoints and retained immutable nodes for intermediate ancestry. This does not adopt this historical transition/recovery/restore proposal."
    },
